sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User as User (Frontend SAPUI5)
    participant UserController as UserController (.NET API)
    participant UserService as UserService
    participant DB as SQL Database
    participant TicketController as TicketController (.NET API)
    participant TicketService as TicketService (Business Logic)
    participant Mail as Mail

    %% --- AUTHENTICATION ---
    User->>UserController: {username, password}
    UserController->>UserService: ValidateCredentials()
    UserService->>DB: SELECT User WHERE username=...
    DB-->>UserService: User data + PasswordHash
    UserService-->>UserController: AuthResult (success)
    UserController-->>User: JWT Token / Auth Session

    rect rgb(240,240,255)
    Note over User,UserController: User stores token and sends it<br/>with Authorization: Bearer <token>
    end

    %% --- CREATE TICKET ---
    User->>TicketController: POST /api/tickets/create {title, desc, locId}<br/>+ Authorization: Bearer token
    TicketController->>TicketService: CreateTicket(request)

    TicketService->>DB: INSERT INTO Tickets (...)
    DB-->>TicketService: TicketId returned

  
    TicketService->>DB: UPDATE Ticket
    DB-->>TicketService: OK

    TicketService-->>TicketController: TicketCreatedResponse (TicketId)
    TicketController-->>User: 201 Created + Ticket Details

    %% --- EMAIL NOTIFICATION ---
    Note over TicketService,Mail: Optional background job<br/>for ticket confirmation email
    TicketService->>Mail: SendEmailNotification()